    "storyline": {
      "real": "H\u00e4kkinen crashes out of the lead at the final chicane after 17 laps, leaving Coulthard ahead of Schumacher. Coulthard is on one stop; Ferrari bring Schumacher in early with little fuel, and he sprints while Coulthard loses time behind backmarkers. A second quick stop from a lead of more than 20 s keeps Schumacher in front, and he wins by 4.265 s."
    },
