    },
    "briefing": "Imola, 1999. H\u00e4kkinen has crashed out of the lead, and you run Schumacher, second and a few seconds behind Coulthard, who is on one stop. Stay on one stop, or split the race into two short stints and sprint? Bring the Ferrari home at least second, and catch Coulthard if you can.",
